                "text": "It was great meeting with Chef @mulvaneyp and Chef Santana Diaz of @ucdavishealth today.\n \nI\u2019m proud to have joined them at the @WhiteHouse Conference on Hunger, Nutrition, and Health yesterday to make sure that Sacramento's ideas shined as an example to follow. https://t.co/VMGWcmjaNJ",
