                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Recently, I visited Galt to highlight @sac_coe and @SacPublicHealth\u2019s \u201cSchools as Centers of Wellness\u201d program.\n\nAs a long-time fighter for improving our nation\u2019s mental health care, I support @SacCountyCA's innovative efforts to address youth mental health in our community. https://t.co/ZhSb0Bj7qz",
