                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I met with Alchemist CDC Executive Director Sam Greenlee for a trip to the Florin Farmers Market. Our farmers markets are world-class, and are also a lifeline for Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP) recipients.\n\nIf the Republicans follow through with their plan to cut $300 billion from SNAP, these markets and our families will suffer greatly. I will keep fighting to make sure that your food security and small business aren\u2019t sacrificed so the richest Americans can get richer.",
